<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the world youth</p>
<p>championship on Saturday:</p>
<p>3rd/4th places</p>
<p> Ireland   2   Ghana   1   (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ireland - Dessie Baker 1, Damien Duff 32</p>
<p>Ghana - Baba Sule 5.</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Argentina  2  Uruguay 1 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Argentina - Esteban Cambiasso 24, Diego Quitana 41</p>
<p>Uruguay - Pablo Gabriel Garcia Perez 14</p>
</text>
